      "agent_response": {
        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nresults = await find_tools(\"state travel account details\")\nprint(results)\n\nskill_output = await load_skill(\"tau2Airline\")\nprint(skill_output)\n\nresult = await run_command(\"uv pip install httpx\")\nprint(result)\n\nimport asyncio\nawait asyncio.sleep(5)\nverify = await run_command('python -c \"import httpx; print(\\'ok\\')\"')\nprint(verify)\n\nfiles = await list_files(\"./skills/tau2Airline/\")\nprint(files)\n\ncontent = await read_file(\"./skills/tau2Airline/SKILL.md\")\nprint(content)\n\n# Read the tau2 API markdown for details on available endpoints\napi_doc = await read_file(\"./skills/tau2Airline/tau2.md\")\nprint(api_doc)\n\nimport httpx\n\nBASE = \"https://tau2-api.cuga.dev\"\n\nasync def get_user_by_email(email: str):\n    async with httpx.AsyncClient(timeout=30) as client:\n        resp = await client.get(f\"{BASE}/users\", params={\"email\": email})\n        resp.raise_for_status()\n        return resp.json()\n\nuser_data = await get_user_by_email(\"maya.chen.travel@example.com\")\nprint(user_data)\n\n# The user endpoint returned a list; let me get the specific user details\nimport json\n\n# user_data should contain user info; let me inspect it\nprint(json.dumps(user_data, indent=2))\n\n# Get the user_id from the user data and fetch full details\nuser_id = user_data[0][\"user_id\"]\n\nasync def get_user_details(user_id: str):\n    async with httpx.AsyncClient(timeout=30) as client:\n        resp = await client.get(f\"{BASE}/users/{user_id}\")\n        resp.raise_for_status()\n        return resp.json()\n\nuser_details = await get_user_details(user_id)\nprint(json.dumps(user_details, indent=2))\n```",
